speedbot_claim_collaboration_bonus: description, inputSchema  -execution_test_type +execution_test_type, private_execution_evidence -private_execution_evidence; +execution_result (delivered plus pass/fail for each acceptance criterion); +Failed tests earn the same reward as passing tests. -evidence +evidence, structured result -its digest +digests -attest. +attest; for a field-test result the tested provider may instead dispute within 72 hours, and without a response the claim proceeds.  parameters: +input.execution_result input.execution_result.criteria input.execution_result.criteria.criterion input.execution_result.criteria.passed input.execution_result.delivered input.execution_result.delivery_seconds input.execution_result.input_sha256 input.execution_result.output_schema_valid
speedbot_field_test_report: description  -evidence +evidence, structured result, provider confirmation state -digest; +digests;
added speedbot_dispute_field_test
